SUMMARY:Holiday Tree Lighting Block Party!
DESCRIPTION:We’re getting ready for the most wonderful time of the year\, and that means the return of the annual Grove Arcade Holiday Tree Lighting Block Party! Join us on Saturday\, November 28\, for a day of holiday festivities in the heart of downtown Asheville. \nThe celebration kicks off with the Southern Highland Craft Guild Holiday Market at 10AM\, followed by an evening of live entertainment\, festive drinks\, and holiday traditions for the whole family. \nThis year\, enjoy holiday cheer with: \n🎄 Live performances by @ashevilleballet\n🎄 Live music from the Bill Bares Jazz Trio\n🎄 Caroling by the @avlgmc\n🎄 A visit from Santa Claus\, with photo opportunities\n🎄 A festive DJ set by @rockthediscosoundsystem \, featuring the @captainsofrevelry\n🎄 Outdoor pop-up bars on Restaurant Row\n🎄 A family-friendly Letters to Santa crafting station\n🎄 The @craftguild Holiday Market\n…and more!
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/holiday-tree-lighting-block-party/
LOCATION:The Grove Arcade
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,DJ/Electronic,Live Music
END:VEVENT
