SUMMARY:JR. Scarekrow
DESCRIPTION:Your neighborhood JR. ScareKrow are here to make some music here at Barleys today. A little grit\, a little soul\, some serious guitar picking\, and a whole lot of Asheville character. Come see what these local favorites have cooking on the Street Level stage! Looking forward to the musical adventure that will be. Come out and hang out with us. \n\nSaturday night at Barley’s is stacked.\n\n\nLIVE MUSIC TONIGHT with Izzi Highes & Andrew Thelston bringing it downstairs — then keep it going late night with DJ Nex Millen upstairs.\n\n\nNo cover. Full bar. Cold beer. Late-night eats. Two floors of Saturday night fun in the heart of downtown Asheville.\n\n\n\nOpen 4PM–1AM\n42 Biltmore Ave. | Downtown AVL\n21+ Only | NO COVER\n\n  \nBarley’s – Asheville’s Original Downtown Gathering Place Since 1994\, serving amazing pizza\, wings\, salads & more with two full bars\, pool tables\, darts\, shuffleboard\, and an experienced & friendly staff. \nLive Music. DJs. Craft Beer. Cocktails. Pizza. Late Nights. Open Thursday-Monday with late night food. barleystaproom.com \n*21+ only; valid ID required
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/scarekrow-friends-2/
LOCATION:Barley’s Downtown\, 42 Biltmore Ave\, Asheville\, North Carolina\, 28801
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Screenshot-2026-10-16-220336-e1795636226311.png
GEO:35.5932923;-82.5509832
